@startuml A2_02_component_rag_service_simple
title RAG API Service (rag_api) – Simplified View

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
}

rectangle "RAG API Service\n**8010** host (compose)\n8000 in-container" as RAG_SERVICE {
  rectangle "Document ingest\nchunk + embed" as INGESTION
  rectangle "Query pipeline\nvector similarity" as QUERY
}

database "Postgres\n+ pgvector\n(optional Mongo)" as DB
cloud "OpenAI\nEmbeddings" as OPENAI
cloud "Observability" as OBS

INGESTION --> OPENAI : embeddings
INGESTION --> DB : store vectors
QUERY --> DB : vector search
RAG_SERVICE --> OBS

note right of RAG_SERVICE
**Role:** Stateless document RAG
**Neo4j / prereqs:** use **rag_graph** (A2_03)
end note

@enduml
